__________
File guide:
filtered_treatment_history_matrix: a lag matrix for curly-leaf pond weed
lakes/treatments. Rows are PI Surveys. They are filtered to only surveys for
lakes we have date-specific (PAR or end-of-year survey) treatment information,
and then any missing treatment years for those surveys are filled in with permit
data.

_________
UPDATES:

7/29/26: I deleted rows from our filtered_treatment_history_matrix where 
the permit data has a 1 in lag0 but the treatment matrix has a 0 in both
lag0_before and lag0_after, since we do not know the exact treatment date.

7/24/26: I made a permit matrix using the same methodology
as the treatment matrix to check for places in the treatment matrix where 
we are probably missing treatments. There were 40 cells that were 1s in the
permit matrix but 0s in the treatment matrix. Those were added to the treatment
history matrix as 2s (so I can look into them later).

